    "title": "What channel is Arizona-Michigan game tonight? What time is NCAA Final Four game? Schedule, scores",
    "text": "Updated April 4, 2026, 9:06 p.m. ETThe Michigan Wolverines will face the Arizona Wildcats in the NCAA Final Four.The game is scheduled for Saturday, April 4, 2026, at 8:54 p.m. ET in Indianapolis.Viewers can watch the matchup on TBS or stream it on SlingTV.Michigan enters the game with a 35-3 record, while Arizona holds a 36-2 record.The Michigan Wolverines play the Arizona Wildcats in the Final Four of the NCAA men's basketball tournament in March Madness action tonight on TBS.Here's what you need to know about Arizona, Michigan, tonight's matchup, how to watch, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds and more:March Madness 2026 NCAA Final Four schedule today: When does NCAA Final 4 men's basketball play at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis?The first of two NCAA Final Four basketball games is slated to begin at 6:09 p.m. ET Saturday, April 4, 2026, at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis:Illinois Fighting Illini and Connecticut Huskies, 6:09 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4Arizona Wildcats and Michigan Wolverines, 9:19 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4March Madness 2026 NCAA championship men's basketball game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Final Four on SlingWhat channel is the Michigan Wolverines vs Arizona Wildcats game on TV today, Saturday, April 4? How to watch Arizona-Michigan March Madness 2026 NCAA Final Four game tonight liveThe Arizona Wildcats and Michigan Wolverines will air on TBS Saturday, April 4, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingWhat time is Arizona Wildcats vs Michigan Wolverines NCAA Final 4 game start today, Saturday, April 4? When is Michigan-Arizona March Madness 2026 NCAA Final Four game tonight liveThe Arizona Wildcats and Michigan Wolverines will play on TBS at 9:19 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingHow to stream Michigan-Arizona Final Four game today, Saturday, April 4. Where to watch Arizona-Michigan March Madness 2026 NCAA Final 4 game tonight liveThe Michigan Wolverines and Arizona Wildcats will stream SlingTV at 9:19 pm. ET, Saturday, April 4, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action with a free SlingTV trial2025-2026 Michigan Wolverines season record, Big Ten conference recordMichigan Wolverines: (35-3, 19-1 Big Ten)Michigan basketball 2026 NCAA tournament results: How Wolverines reached NCAA Final Four in March Madness bracketFirst round: Michigan 101, Howard 80Second round: Michigan 95, Saint Louis 72Sweet 16: Michigan 90, Alabama 77Elite 8: Michigan 95, Tennessee 622025-2026 Arizona Wildcats season record, Big 12 conference recordArizona Wildcats: (36-2, 16-2 Big 12)Arizona basketball 2026 NCAA tournament results: How Wildcats reached NCAA Final Four in March Madness bracketFirst round: Arizona 92, Long Island 58Second round: Arizona 78, Utah State 66Sweet 16: Arizona 109, Arkansas 88Elite 8: Arizona 79, Purdue 64March Madness 2026 NCAA Final Four odds for men's basketball betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.Michigan Wolverines men's basketball roster 2026: NCAA Final Four March Madness at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis0, Ricky Liburd1, Trey McKenney2, L.J. Cason3, Elliot Cadeau4, Nimari Burnett5, Oscar Goodman7, Howard Eisley Jr.10, Winters Grady11, Roddy Gayle Jr.12, Charlie May13, Harrison Hockberg15, Aday Mara21, Morez Johnson Jr.23, Yaxel Lendeborg32, Malick Kordel42, Will TschetterWho are Michigan's best players?Yaxel Lendeborg averages 14.9 points, 7.0 rebounds and shoots 37.4% from 3=-point range.Morez Johnson Jr. averages 13.2 points and 7.3 rebounds.Aday Mara averages 11.9 points, 6.8 rebounds and 2.6 blocked shots.Elliot Cadeau averages 10.3 points and 5.7 assists, making 37.5% of his 3s.Trey McKenney averages 9.7 points, making 38.5% of his 3s.2025-26 Michigan Wolverines basketball team statsMichigan averages 87.5 points and 18.8 assists per game (both No. 4 nationally). The Wolverines shoot 51.1% from the field (No. 3), and 61.2% on 2-pointers (No. 2).The Wolverines limit opponents to 38.6% shooting, the nation's best.Michigan corrals 27.4 defensive rebounds per game (No. 3) and hold a 9-rebound edge per game.Going inside against Michigan is fraught with danger. It's 6.1 blocked shots per game are No. 2 in the nation.Michigan basketball coach Dusty MayDusty May has Michigan in the Final Four in his second season. He coached Florida Atlantic for six seasons before joining Michigan, leading the Owls to the 2023 Final Four. May grew up in Greene County, Indiana, and was a student manager for Bob Knight's Indiana teams from 1996-2000.Arizona Wildcats men's basketball roster 2026: NCAA Final Four March Madness at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis0, Jaden Bradley2, Dwayne Aristode3, Anthony Dell'Orso5, Brayden Burries6, Bryce James7, Jackson Francois8, Ivan Kharachenkov10, Koa Peat11, Jackson Cook13, Motiejus Krivas15, Sidi Gueye20, Mabil Mawut21, Evan Nelson22, Addison Arnold30, Tobe Awaka42, Sven DjopmoWho are Arizona's best players?Brayden Burries averages 16.1 points with 40.2% 3-point shooting and 4.9 rebounds.Koa Peat averages 14.1 points and 5.5 rebounds. Jaden Bradley averages 13.3 points on 39.4% 3-point shooting and 4.4 assists.Ivan Kharchenkov averages 10.5 points and 4.3 rebounds.Motiejus Krivas averages 10.4 points and 8.2 rebounds.2025-26 Arizona Wildcats basketball team statsArizona doesn't bother much with 3-pointers, ranking near the bottom of the nation in makes (5.9) and attempts (16.0).Arizona punishes opponents, shooting 50.3% from the field (No. 7 in the nation) and getting to the free-throw line often (19.7 makes on 26.8 attempts, No. 3 in each).Wildcats opponents shoot 39.2% from the field (No. 4) and 31.0% on 3-pointers (No. 35).The Wildcats dominate rebounding, averaging 42.6 per game (No. 2), with an 11-rebound edge per game.Arizona basketball coach Tommy LloydTommy Lloyd is in his fifth season as Arizona coach after a long stint as a Gonzaga assistant. He owns a 148-35 record and has made the NCAA Tournament in all five seasons.How did the March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament experts fare? Bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.Chris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.",
